    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d415">

                <pb facs="0409" n="293" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg293"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811.34537/77.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-01-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 23, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Guantánamo matter is now before the Senate, and the Secretary of State
                    expects the act to be ready in a few days for signature.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
